t Ebon Gables. It }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f171\fs36\insrsid11230260\charrsid2451557 wa}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f171\fs36\insrsid2451557\charrsid2451557 s}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f171\fs36\insrsid2451557 
. But not quite.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f171\fs36\insrsid11230260  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f171\fs36\insrsid2451557 E}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f171\fs36\insrsid11230260 nough about the choir 
was similar, the podium was adorned with my very own Holy Tome. Open to what passage, I knew not. But so much else was\'85 different. This place was older. Less cared-for}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f171\fs36\insrsid2451557 , almost derelict}{
