\ltrch\fcs0 \f187\fs32\insrsid6190639 \'94 He stormed forward, reeled back a palm-
\par And he hit her so hard, her legs came out from under her. 
\par I was not wanting for propriety, but for God\rquote s sake, she was holding a newborn pup. I acted before I could even consider otherwise, easily catching and steadying the woman by the shoulder and arm, bend
ing to a crouch. She was still reeling, snuffing out in obviously pained shock through her battered nose, her pup shrieking in fear where it was still clutched to her shoulder. I tipped my muzzle down for just a moment to make sure the babe was safe- he w
as, she had a tight hold on him- before turning my attention back to the man.
